    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A firearm and a staff made one, as a musket staff is. When it first goes into a creature's inventory, it asks the one who put it there for the two-handed firearm it's built on and the staff merged with it, and becomes a +1 firearm of that kind (or the staff's runes, if it has better) with a Reinforced Stock permanently attached, whose runes apply to Strikes with the stock as well. It holds the staff's spells and is prepared following the same rules as a staff. Its level is the staff's, one higher for the +1, or the firearm's if that's higher, and its price the staff's, the firearm's and the +1's.</p>\n<p>Until it's merged, it's a flintlock musket.</p>",
